5a0783.avif?t=1721145421\" width=526 height=86 /></span><br>1.Auro: Fishing is done automatically.<br>2.Manual: Fishing is done manually.<br>3.Fish Encyclopedia: View the fish you have caught.<br>4.Total number of fish caught.<br><br>When fishing, you can't grab Wanwano.<br>You can't grab the hut when fishing.<br><br><br>\u30fbAuto fishing<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049900/extras/31f50eb80be99b3c6920734f8500319f.avif?t=1721145421\" width=688 height=300 /></span><br>It automatically continues to catch fish.<br>To exit, press the Exit button above Hut.<br><br><br>\u30fbManual fishing<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049900/extras/bab2848dd4117aac742ba49814bea36c.avif?t=1721145421\" width=410 height=356 /></span><br>A fish will be hooked over time.<br>Press the Stop button when the blue bar overlaps the red bar.<br><br><br>\u30fbFish Encyclopedia<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049900/extras/11afac4e918484b619cbb985764e1ab2.avif?t=1721145421\" width=388 height=388 /></span><br>1.Fish number<br>2.Number of fish caught<br>3.Fish Pictures<br>4.Next<br>5.Close the menu.<br><br><br>Options<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049900/extras/eea19108856e99a9a40331602ab4d7b2.avif?t=1721145421\" width=526 height=86 /></span><br>1.Small/2.Big\uff1aChange the size of the character.<br>3.Description Icon\uff1aShow/hide the description icon when the cursor is hovered over the Wanwano and the hut.<br>4.Monitor change\uff1aSwitches the monitor if there are multiple monitors.<br><br><br>Other<br>F12key: Move the position of the wanwano and the hut to the center.",
